Add Teledyne LeCroy T3PS30051P and T3PS3000 DC power supply drivers with typed
QCoDeS parameters, validated voltage and current limits, output measurements,
and example notebooks. The T3PS30051P avoids unsupported ``*IDN?`` queries and
waits one second before reading query responses. The T3PS3000 driver also supports channel tracking,
timer sequences, and LAN configuration.
